<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>MAKEMEFEELALIVE</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">You Me At Six</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">SUCKAPUNCH</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">7AMllrhJtXgcTtJUbbF3PR</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.310" end="00:15.870">Where is your empathy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.870" end="00:17.410">Drain me of my energy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.410" end="00:19.260">Snakes keep on circling me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.260" end="00:22.580">Hiatus from the haters</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.580" end="00:24.290">They ain't the ones that made us</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.290" end="00:28.170">And no one came to save us</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.170" end="00:31.200">Age, sex, location, divided as a nation</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.200" end="00:35.030">The lost generation?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.030" end="00:36.710">Lets start the conversation</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.710" end="00:38.710">How do we alienate them</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.710" end="00:42.580">2020 invasion of the senses</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.580" end="00:45.500">Sell the kids the dream, we're on the same team</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.500" end="00:51.850">Lets build their self esteem just to fucking tear it down again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.850" end="00:54.650">Make me feel alive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.650" end="00:57.950">Make me feel alive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.950" end="01:01.850">I'm fucking dead inside</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.850" end="01:05.290">Make me feel alive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.290" end="01:08.520">Make me feel alive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.520" end="01:12.180">'Cause I'm so fucking dead inside</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.180" end="01:17.930" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.930" end="01:19.430">You try and fill the papers</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.130" end="01:20.980">With dream state connotations</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.980" end="01:24.730">But we don't wanna read them</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.730" end="01:26.500">Fuck what the facts are</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.500" end="01:28.120">Lets just get their backs up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.120" end="01:31.930">Forget what the plan was</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.930" end="01:35.180">I gotta confess, I know I'm the best</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.180" end="01:38.870">It's all in your head when you say that we're depressed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.870" end="01:42.350">Lines ain't my thing, drinking's more my scene</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.350" end="01:44.290">I want to numb the pain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.290" end="01:48.030">You want to get clean</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.030" end="01:51.170">Make me feel alive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.170" end="01:54.860">Make me feel alive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.860" end="01:58.850">I'm fucking dead inside</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.850" end="02:02.330">Make me feel alive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.330" end="02:05.750">Make me feel alive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.750" end="02:07.250">I'm so fucking dead inside</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.940" end="02:10.940" /></div></body></tt>